@startuml forms-vol05-flow
title Sample flow - an emergency call (volume 5)
autonumber

actor Caller as C
participant "Dispatch\nstation" as DISP
participant "Ambulance\ncrew" as CREW
participant "Hospital\n(vol 1)" as H

C -> DISP : emergency call
DISP -> DISP : 142 call registration, 143 call card
DISP -> CREW : crew dispatched
CREW -> CREW : 143 call card (on-scene assessment & treatment)
alt transport to hospital
  CREW -> H : 144 accompanying sheet -> handover, 001 admission (vol 1)
end
alt air ambulance / disaster
  DISP -> DISP : 146 emergency situations, 149 air-ambulance calls
  CREW -> CREW : 150 consultant physician sheet
end

DISP -> DISP : 145 daily substation workload summary

note over DISP, CREW
  The call card (143) is the on-scene clinical record; the observation
  sheet (144) accompanies the patient to hospital. The dispatch logs
  are registers you query.
end note
@enduml
